  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VNM002N Vietnam JR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JR proposes a multi-sectoral response to the typhoon and flooding, taking into account immediate relief as well as early recovery in a phased approach, in line with the UN Floods Response Plan which puts forward this phased approach. The JR will be implemented in the four provinces among the most affected by the flooding and typhoon Molvane, including Quang Binh, Quang Tri, Ha Tinh and Quang Nam. CARE will focus on WASH activities and Food security and Livelihoods support (incl. cash) in Quang Tri.</narrative>
  </description>
